  "releaseNotes": "Behavior change: run history is now pruned automatically, keeping 100 runs per job and 30 days of history by default. Adjust or disable via BackgroundJobDashboardOptions.RunHistoryRetention. A new internal recurring cleanup job performs the sweep hourly and is hidden from the dashboard. Added indexes on the run and run-log tables to keep dashboard queries and DELETEs fast. Dashboard now lets you view the full log history for any recent run via a Show logs toggle on each row, and pauses auto-refresh after three consecutive 5xx responses so server errors stop flooding the log.",
